Baseline model is on the ml-training branch: ml/model.onnx + ml/classes.json.

- Input: 1x3x224x224 float32 RGB image, resized to 224x224, scaled to 0-1,
  then normalized with mean [0.485, 0.456, 0.406] and std [0.229, 0.224, 0.225].
- Output: 6 scores (logits) in the order listed in classes.json. Apply softmax
  to get confidence.
- This is a BASELINE trained on lab (PlantVillage-style) images only. ~99% on the
  lab test set, but only ~40% on real-world photos. Use it to build and test
  the Pi code. A better model will replace the same file later.
